  "question": "Below what amount can CUNY use informal purchasing methods for general purchases?",
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "CUNY may use informal purchasing methods for general purchases that are less than $250,000. This rule is set by CUNY's Procurement Policy and Procedures (2019). The policy also notes that the State Comptroller may authorize a different amount.",
